# Raw/intermediate data-pipeline output. The live site only ever reads
# data/financial_dataset_sp500.json and data/esg_dataset_sp500.json (see
# js/data.js) -- everything else here is scratch input/output from the
# scripts/ pipeline (raw source dumps, enrichment reports, pre-merge
# backups, session notes) that was previously tracked in git and, because
# this repo is what GitHub Pages deploys from, was publicly served at
# every path under truenorthportfolios.com/data/. Kept locally so the
# pipeline scripts still work; no longer committed. See README.md.
